{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"この記事を読む前に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この記事は昨日書きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n中田がアイドルだということを\nちょっと忘れてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はヲタ活してきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日にイベはたくさんあるけど\n日曜日にオフはあんまりないから\n行くしか！ってなって\n2つはしごしてきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n東京女子流さんの公開生放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーもでたことある\nNACK5さんの『i-BAN!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーのサイン\nかざってあった(￣∇￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子流さん人気すぎて人いっぱいで\nあんまり見えなかったけど\nかまいませーん！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークがもう可愛くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークで可愛いとか\nもう敵いません(*´Д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きまして\n愛乙女☆DOLLさんのインストアライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らぶどるさん見るのは\n1か月ぶりくらいだったっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沸きました(*´Д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな可愛くて\nキレキレで全力なダンス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDにならざるを得ない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はらしくない髪型で\nメイクも薄くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生くらいに見られました(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一種の変装のつもりだったんだが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！でも\nアイドルに沸いてる所を見られるのは\nはずいけど\n気づいたら話しかけてくださる方が嬉しいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、イベントといえば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"KANAZAWA　GIRLS　FESTIVAL２０１３\nに出させていただけるみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみだあああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字入力のモードは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nフリックから変わってないよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恵方巻き食べたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/02/04/3620791/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご(*´Д｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}